This directory redistributes one official manylinux x86_64 wheel with a
single METADATA change: the cryptography Requires-Dist upper bound `<49`
is removed so ContextualWisdomLab required Strix can keep
cryptography==50.0.0 (CVE-2026-69247 / CVE-2026-39892). See SOURCE.json
for the official URL and SHA-256. The Apache-2.0 license text remains
inside the wheel's .dist-info directory.
